From 13f44655b459e4aea6d1f40eed48d883d2d13731 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "MOTOR-43 (Claude)" <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 18:13:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] l10n: translate the sync "Passwords" data type label

IDS_SETTINGS_PASSWORDS_AND_PASSKEYS_CHECKBOX_LABEL is mapped to
IDS_SETTINGS_BRAVE_PASSWORDS_CHECKBOX_LABEL ("Passwords"), but our
brave_generated_resources_*.xtb lacked its translation (message id
7029809446516969842), so the sync data type list showed it in English.
Take the translations verbatim from Brave 1.98.63's xtb files (53
locales; sr has none upstream either).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MwmK2keCUcEPJ6KTcxicZD
